<title>ALBANIA: Albania Q3 budget deficit grows to 9.3 bln leks.</title>
<headline>Albania Q3 budget deficit grows to 9.3 bln leks.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday:</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT BUDGET (in million leks)</p>
<p>					Q3 1996     Q2 1996  Q3 1995</p>
<p> Balance			     -9,369	-7,270    -7,067</p>
<p> Revenue			     13,075	12,752    12,450</p>
<p> Expenditure			 22,444	20,022    19,517</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
